  "id": "alexithymia",
  "term": "alexithymia",
  "definition": "Alexithymia is a pattern of difficulty recognizing, making sense of, and putting feelings into words. It is often discussed as involving both problems with the thinking side of emotion and with emotional processing, and it can affect relationships and empathy while occurring either with or without other mental health conditions.",
